  m_Name: Basic Knife upgraded
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nameEnglish: Zhong Kui's Hunt Knife
  descriptionEnglish: Those who have witnessed Azaus in battle tell tales of the
    power that emanates from his blade. With each swing, a brilliant blue energy
    surges forth, striking fear into the hearts of his demonic foes. Some even whisper
    that these energies are the very souls of the demons he has slain, forever trapped
    within the weapon.  Azaus received this knife as a gift from Zhong Kui, one of
    the renowned Demon slayers.
  nameChinese: "\u949F\u9997\u730E\u5200"
  descriptionChinese: "\u90A3\u4E9B\u89C1\u8FC7\u963F\u624E\u65AF\u6218\u6597\u7684\u4EBA\uFF0C\u90FD\u4F20\u9882\u7740\u4ED6\u5200\u4E0A\u6240\u6563\u53D1\u7684\u529B\u91CF\u3002\u6BCF\u4E00\u6B21\u6325\u821E\uFF0C\u90FD\u4F1A\u6D8C\u51FA\u4E00\u80A1\u7480\u74A8\u7684\u84DD\u8272\u80FD\u91CF\uFF0C\u4EE4\u6076\u9B54\u5FC3\u751F\u754F\u60E7\u3002\u6709\u4E9B\u4EBA\u751A\u81F3\u4F20\u8A00\u8FD9\u4E9B\u80FD\u91CF\u662F\u4ED6\u6240\u6740\u6076\u9B54\u7684\u7075\u9B42\uFF0C\u6C38\u8FDC\u88AB\u56F0\u5728\u6B66\u5668\u4E4B\u4E2D\u3002\u963F\u624E\u65AF\u662F\u4ECE\u949F\u9997\u90A3\u91CC\u5F97\u5230\u8FD9\u628A\u5200\u7684\uFF0C\u949F\u9997\u662F\u8457\u540D\u7684\u6076\u9B54\u730E\u624B\u4E4B\u4E00\u3002"
  namePortuguese: "Faca de Ca\xE7a de Zhong Kui"
  descriptionPortuguese: "Aqueles que testemunharam Azaus em batalha contam hist\xF3rias
    do poder que emana de sua l\xE2mina. Com cada golpe, uma energia azul brilhante
    irrompe, causando medo nos cora\xE7\xF5es de seus inimigos demon\xEDacos. Alguns
    at\xE9 sussurram que essas energias s\xE3o as almas dos dem\xF4nios que ele matou,
    para sempre presas na arma. Azaus recebeu esta faca como presente de Zhong Kui,
    um dos renomados ca\xE7adores de dem\xF4nios."
  nameSpanish: Cuchillo de caza de Zhong Kui
  weaponDescriptionSpanish: "Aquellos que han sido testigos de Azaus en batalla cuentan
    historias del poder que emana de su hoja. Con cada golpe, una energ\xEDa azul
    brillante surge, infundiendo miedo en los corazones de sus enemigos demon\xEDacos.
    Algunos incluso susurran que estas energ\xEDas son las almas mismas de los demonios
    que ha matado, atrapadas para siempre dentro del arma. Azaus recibi\xF3 este
    cuchillo como regalo de Zhong Kui, uno de los renombrados cazadores de demonios."
